# Alucard, Demon Hunter

> Alucard is a lifesteal skirmisher, not a blind carry button. He wins when the enemy draft lets him chain skills into passive dashes without being pinned, and he looks ordinary when every entrance gets answered by suppression, knockups, or burst before his sustain starts working.

